---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";

const categories = [
  { id: "functional", label: "Funzionale", locked: true },
  { id: "preferences", label: "Preferenze" },
  { id: "statistics", label: "Statistiche" },
  { id: "marketing", label: "Marketing" },
];
---

<div class="cookie-banner" data-cookie-banner hidden role="dialog" aria-labelledby="cookie-title">
  <div class="cookie-banner__head">
    <p class="cookie-banner__title" id="cookie-title">Gestisci Consenso Cookie</p>
    <button class="cookie-banner__close" type="button" aria-label="Chiudi" data-cookie-choice="deny">
      <Icon name="close" />
    </button>
  </div>
  <p class="cookie-banner__text">
    Per fornire le migliori esperienze, utilizziamo tecnologie come i cookie per memorizzare e/o accedere alle
    informazioni del dispositivo. Il consenso a queste tecnologie ci permetterà di elaborare dati come il comportamento
    di navigazione o ID unici su questo sito. Non acconsentire o ritirare il consenso può influire negativamente su
    alcune caratteristiche e funzioni.
  </p>
  <ul class="cookie-banner__categories" data-cookie-categories hidden>
    {
      categories.map((category) => (
        <li>
          <label>
            <span>{category.label}</span>
            {category.locked ? (
              <em>Sempre attivo</em>
            ) : (
              <input type="checkbox" name={category.id} />
            )}
          </label>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
  <div class="cookie-banner__buttons">
    <button type="button" class="cookie-banner__btn cookie-banner__btn--accept" data-cookie-choice="accept">Accetta</button>
    <button type="button" class="cookie-banner__btn" data-cookie-choice="deny">Nega</button>
    <button type="button" class="cookie-banner__btn" data-cookie-preferences>Visualizza le preferenze</button>
    <button type="button" class="cookie-banner__btn" data-cookie-choice="save" hidden>Salva preferenze</button>
  </div>
  <p class="cookie-banner__links">
    <a href="/cookie-policy-ue/">Cookie Policy</a>
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .cookie-banner {
    position: fixed;
    right: 10px;
    bottom: 10px;
    z-index: 70;
    width: min(calc(100% - 20px), 526px);
    padding: 15px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    color: #222;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cookie-banner[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .cookie-banner__head {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cookie-banner__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .cookie-banner__close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .cookie-banner__close :global(svg) {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .cookie-banner__text {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .cookie-banner__categories {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .cookie-banner__categories[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .cookie-banner__categories label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    background: #f2f2f2;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .cookie-banner__categories em {
    color: #1e73be;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .cookie-banner__buttons {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .cookie-banner__btn {
    min-height: 45px;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #f2f2f2;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    color: #222;
    font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .cookie-banner__btn[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .cookie-banner__btn--accept {
    border-color: #000;
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .cookie-banner__links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
  }

  .cookie-banner__links a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cookie-banner__buttons {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
